<title>THAILAND: Grammy Entertainment Q3 net up 33 pct.</title>
<headline>Grammy Entertainment Q3 net up 33 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consolidated financial results for three and nine months ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				 Third quarter</p>
<p>    Share (baht)	     3.15	 vs	   2.36</p>
<p>    Net profit	     157.61	 vs	 118.11</p>
<p>				 Nine months</p>
<p>    Share (baht)	     8.37	 vs	   7.00</p>
<p>    Net profit	     418.59	 vs	 345.59</p>
<p>NOTES: Company's full name is Grammy Entertainment Plc, a music and television programme producer.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
</text>
